<BaseLayout title="About | Sloane Keay Davidson" description="Background and credentials for Sloane Davidson, Technical Product and Program Manager and Solutions Architect."><div class="stack gap-20"><main class="wrapper about stack gap-10"><Hero title="About" tagline="Technical depth, thoughtful collaboration, and clear execution."/><section><h2>Career background</h2><div><p>My background spans enterprise healthcare engineering, multi-client implementation management, federal software environments, and building a SaaS platform. I work at the intersection of what teams are building, why it matters, and what it takes to deliver it.</p><p>I am especially interested in technical program and product roles where strategy, engineering fluency, stakeholder collaboration, and execution are equally important.</p></div></section><section><h2>Credentials</h2><div><p>Active Federal Security Clearance</p><p>M.S., Computer Science (Software Engineering), Kennesaw State University, 2022</p></div></section><section><h2>Technical expertise</h2><div><p>Product strategy and roadmaps · React · JavaScript and Node.js · Supabase · PostgreSQL · Stripe Connect · REST APIs · CI/CD · Jenkins · Git · healthcare reporting workflows</p></div></section></main><ContactCTA/></div></BaseLayout>
